      "markdown": "# Part A(3) Let's spell\n\n## 基础全练\n\n## 一、 圈出与图片相符的单词。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_149_396_258_496.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"5%\" /></div>\n\n\n1.\n\nA. computer B. eraser\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_145_510_291_606.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"7%\" /></div>\n\n\n2.\n\nA. book B. dinner\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_147_620_281_731.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"6%\" /></div>\n\n\n3.\n\nA. father          B. sister\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_146_747_292_849.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"7%\" /></div>\n\n\n4.\n\nA. tiger          B. ruler\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_144_867_251_996.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"5%\" /></div>\n\n\n5.\n\nA. winter       B. water\n\n## 能力优练\n\n## 二、 看图片，选词填空。\n\n2. The ball is ___ the box.\n\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1214_176_1315_272.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"5%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 三、 看图片，选择正确答案。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1044_457_1390_672.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"17%\" /></div>\n\n\n1. ___, ___ and ___ are on the first floor.\n\n2._____,_____, and _____ are on the second floor.\n\n## 口语乐练\n\n## 四、 读一读，体会单词中所含字母组合“er”的发音。\n\nSister, Sister, can you see?\n\nA hungry tig $ \\underline{er} $ on the TV.\n\nTiger, Tiger, can you see?\n\nDinner for you.\n\nDinner for me.\n\n## 微信公众号\n\ntiger\n\nsister\n\ncomputer\n\ndinner",
